# Supplier-Facts Schema (`companies.*`)

## Primary table
`companies.companies` — always start here for supplier/company questions.
- Join key: `supplier_facts_uuid`
- Always filter `is_deleted = false` unless the user explicitly wants deleted companies
- Platform membership: `platform_ep`, `platform_wlw`
- Industry: `main_business_area`

## Supporting tables

| Table | Contains |
|-------|----------|
| `companies.communication` | Phone numbers and email addresses |
| `companies.contact_information` | Detailed communication data for individual contacts |
| `companies.contacts` | Contact people associated with supplier companies |
| `companies.description` | Multilingual company descriptions |
| `companies.media` | Supplier images, documents, and videos |
| `companies.references` | Supplier reference/contact information |
| `companies.websites` | Website URLs, titles, and source details |
| `companies.company_revisions` | Change history for supplier facts data |

## Deprecated — avoid for new analysis
- `companies.listings` — old; use only for preservation/backfill work
- `companies.revisions` — expected to be deleted; do not use

## Offers
For offer/product data use `supplier_offers.offers`:
- `id` = offer ID
- `supplier_id` links to `companies.companies.supplier_facts_uuid`
- Active offers: `delete_time IS NULL`
- Published offers: `publish_time IS NOT NULL`
- CPV fields: `cpv_category_id`, `data_cpv`, `data_company_category_id`, `data_ontology_concept_id`
